      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Evidence-based care, using principles of clinical epidemiology, promises to alter the treatment of chronic musculoskeletal facial pain. With use of a set of \"rules of evidence,\" research studies may be rigorously evaluated. Clinicians can master this methodology, which may usher in a paradigm shift in clinical care."},
